Aerie-Purpose: Add Aerie's extension proxy validator (https only, no built-in host, loopback only behind a test switch) as an Aerie-owned component with unit tests.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: components/aerie_services (new); components/BUILD.gn (components_unittests deps)
Aerie-Kind: hook

The Web Store install path needs a proxy to download from, and Aerie ships
none: the domain is decided in #19. The setting is empty until the user sets
one. This patch only adds the validator; the next patch wires it into the
Helium services helpers.

